{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00365",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.02,
      "end_seconds": 7.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "Doctor, you know, hello, I've got my papers here, where should I put them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.09,
      "end_seconds": 12.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.15,
      "end_seconds": 29.31,
      "duration_seconds": 16.16,
      "text": "Honestly, um, it's more breathlessness than usual, and my family pushed me to come. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.34,
      "end_seconds": 35.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "When did you first notice it? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.37,
      "end_seconds": 42.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "For ten days, I'd say. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.24,
      "end_seconds": 45.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "How often does it happen?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.98,
      "end_seconds": 51.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "It's every other day. I've had a wheeze too, for about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.81,
      "end_seconds": 55.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.03,
      "end_seconds": 59.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "About a five out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.95,
      "end_seconds": 63.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.71,
      "end_seconds": 67.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Okay, so I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.49,
      "end_seconds": 71.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Any weight loss or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.48,
      "end_seconds": 75.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Okay, so no. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.97,
      "end_seconds": 89.86,
      "duration_seconds": 13.89,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.35,
      "end_seconds": 91.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.1,
      "end_seconds": 97.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.65,
      "end_seconds": 101.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.41,
      "end_seconds": 103.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.62,
      "end_seconds": 105.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.56,
      "end_seconds": 121.56,
      "duration_seconds": 15.0,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.34,
      "end_seconds": 128.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Well, I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.7,
      "end_seconds": 133.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.16,
      "end_seconds": 138.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "I've had COPD for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.28,
      "end_seconds": 153.53,
      "duration_seconds": 14.25,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.9,
      "end_seconds": 158.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Good, you know, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.47,
      "end_seconds": 162.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.87,
      "end_seconds": 176.8,
      "duration_seconds": 11.93,
      "text": "Tiotropium inhaler, once a day. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.88,
      "end_seconds": 180.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.15,
      "end_seconds": 182.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.24,
      "end_seconds": 204.15,
      "duration_seconds": 13.91,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.92,
      "end_seconds": 206.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.85,
      "end_seconds": 210.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.74,
      "end_seconds": 212.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "No, um, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.34,
      "end_seconds": 234.24,
      "duration_seconds": 19.9,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is a flare-up of COPD. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had more breathlessness than usual for ten days, and no weight loss or coughing up blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.14,
      "end_seconds": 237.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Yes, you know, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.57,
      "end_seconds": 241.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.8,
      "end_seconds": 244.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Right, of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.46,
      "end_seconds": 261.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. I'm going to order a chest X-ray, for breathlessness. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.92,
      "end_seconds": 264.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Right, alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.53,
      "end_seconds": 270.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Let's use doxycycline, 100 milligrams, twice a day, for five days. That's for chest infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.89,
      "end_seconds": 274.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Um, alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.86,
      "end_seconds": 294.03,
      "duration_seconds": 19.17,
      "text": "This is a good time to talk about stopping smoking if that's still an issue. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you become more breathless or your lips turn blue."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.38,
      "end_seconds": 295.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.04,
      "end_seconds": 298.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Let's review you in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.96,
      "end_seconds": 303.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.39,
      "end_seconds": 309.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.29,
      "end_seconds": 318.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.53,
      "text": "So, I take the doxycycline, 100 milligrams, twice a day and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.9,
      "end_seconds": 324.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. So, all right, I'll let you go. Any final questions first?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.26,
      "end_seconds": 329.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}